00:04:10.667 --> 00:04:13.497
"and then leave something so
that they could drag you down

00:04:13.497 --> 00:04:14.547
"to their pain."

00:04:15.470 --> 00:04:17.520
So I don't get mad at people.

00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:19.370
Especially 'cause they don't know me.

00:04:20.710 --> 00:04:22.910
I actually feel bad for them.

00:04:22.910 --> 00:04:24.170
And there's something that happens

00:04:24.170 --> 00:04:25.157
