00:04:46.140 --> 00:04:48.720
it's just a human that's living their life

00:04:48.720 --> 00:04:51.770
and they're stuck in a bad place,

00:04:51.770 --> 00:04:54.480
and the only thing they know
how to do in that moment

00:04:54.480 --> 00:04:57.700
is to try to drag somebody else.

00:04:57.700 --> 00:04:59.500
Because they're envious or jealous

00:04:59.500 --> 00:05:01.490
