00:08:29.380 --> 00:08:31.450
one of the most iconic moments of my life

00:08:31.450 --> 00:08:35.640
is Brandon slept over my house
in 1992 before a card show.

00:08:35.640 --> 00:08:39.235
Brandon didn't like
football, didn't play Madden,

00:08:39.235 --> 00:08:41.550
and we played Madden on Genesis

00:08:41.550 --> 00:08:43.680
and the first game I beat him bad.

00:08:43.680 --> 00:08:45.450
