00:09:18.120 --> 00:09:20.080
It is literally still one
of our favorite stories.

00:09:20.080 --> 00:09:20.913
But the best part was

00:09:20.913 --> 00:09:22.280
he actually had a brilliant counter move

00:09:22.280 --> 00:09:23.580
